  "features": [
    "Six native process bindings compile from Home with exact class-header/cache validation, including standalone constants and UV objects.",
    "Process config reports actual backend FIPS mode and pointer width; config/X509 bindings retain per-process private identity.",
    "Priority APIs validate types/ranges before system calls and normalize permission errors to the libuv contract.",
    "UserInfo reads actual account data via libuv, propagates option getters and supports buffer encoding."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "The unchanged broad process file expects ICU to be unsupported; that conflicts with the implemented ICU API and remains #872. The retained full-scope outcome is not declared green.",
    "Initial priority/getter failures and compile diagnostics remain without final passing credit.",
    "Other process-binding stubs, full OS/process/native/API behavior, complete Bun suite and Release/ASAN/all-platform verification remain open under #66."
